    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING MATHEMATICS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "工程數學(二)的內容為二階常微分方程式、拉普拉斯(Laplace)轉換、傅立葉級數與轉換。",
    "describe_eh": "The subjects of Engineering Mathematics (2) include the 2nd-order ODEs, Laplace transform, Fourier series and Fourier transform.\r\n",
